THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This repository contains no third-party code. Two things it interoperates with
are worth naming explicitly:

**Open edX®** is a registered trademark of edX Inc. CourseMate is an independent
plugin. It modifies no Open edX source and is not endorsed by or affiliated with
edX Inc. or the Open edX community.

**The Open edX demo course** (`course-v1:OpenedX+DemoX+DemoCourse`) was used for
development and benchmarking. It is published by the Open edX community under
CC BY-NC-SA and is **not redistributed here** — it is downloaded at setup time by
`tutor local do importdemocourse`. Its Non-Commercial and Share-Alike terms do not
compose with MIT, which is why it is fetched rather than vendored. Benchmark
figures in `docs/BENCHMARKS.md` are measurements taken against it, not copies of
it.

Runtime dependencies (FastAPI, LiteLLM, pydantic, XBlock and others) retain their
own licences and are installed, not vendored.
